meta {
  name: Get TV Season Details
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/tmdb/tv/{{tvId}}/season/{{seasonNumber}}?language={{language}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  language: {{language}}
}

docs {
  # Get TV Season Details

  Fetches episode list and metadata for a specific season of a TV series from TMDB.

  ## Path Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `id` | `number` | Yes | Numeric TMDB TV series ID. |
  | `season` | `number` | Yes | Season number. |

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `language` | `string` | No | `en-US` | Localization language tag. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: TMDB season object including the `episodes` array.
  - **400 Bad Request**: `{ "error": "id and season must be numbers" }`.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

